+++ b/docs/dev/debt/changes/fix-shader-unreadable-root-message.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# shader
+
+## change [uniform fill or table base]
+
+- A value read through a null or unmapped pointer still throws at record time if a [uniform fill or table base](../../../core/shader/recompiler/Optimization/src/SrtWalker/SrtDescriptorEvaluation.cpp) needs it, or if the pointer comes from user data and is not null, even if the console skips the read. The error names the address and the user-data word it was read through (`it reads 0x... through user data word N, which the request's memory does not hold`).
